<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Dear {!IndividualApplication.COE_Name__c},</font></p><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">We are pleased to inform you that the application titled “<b>{!IndividualApplication.Project_Title__c}</b>” submitted by your Center of Excellence (COE) has been&nbsp;<b>shortlisted for presentation&nbsp;</b>before the Selection Committee .<br><br></font><b>WIN Admin Comments:</b><br>{!IndividualApplication.WIN_Approval_Comments__c}<br></p><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">This shortlisting reflects the strength and potential of your proposal. Further details regarding the presentation schedule, guidelines, and next steps will be shared with you shortly.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">We congratulate the entire COE team on reaching this important stage and wish you the very best for the upcoming presentation.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Sincerely,</font></p><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>Wadhwani Foundation</b></font></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>